# Crumbo: tests aur auto-check

- Har feature, bugfix, aur meaningful refactor ke saath tests likho (unit aur/ya widget).
- Task complete tabhi maano jab:
  - `flutter analyze` clean ho
  - `flutter test` saare green hon
- Domain logic (needs decay, economy, card unlocks, journey gates, ad frequency) ke liye unit tests zaroori.
- Analyze ya test fail ho to pehle woh fix karo; naya kaam mat chhoro tootay hue tests ke saath.
- Manual phone check alag hai; yeh auto-check ka replacement nahi — dono chahiye jab task "done" bolo.
